  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Investigative Expert",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "adeptusActor18It",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>The Verispex Adept has a Resolve of 3 whenever dealing with investigations, sorting evidence, or any conclusions thereof in conversation.  Unparalleled Proficiency: The Verispex Adept adds half their unaugmented Intelligence bonus (rounding up) to the Success Levels of any successful ore test. They also have Advantage on Tests made to find or retrieve information from a document or archive (whether analog or digital).  Mechancus Instruction: To represent a higher ranking Verispex Adept that has been initiated in Mechanicus secrets, change Intelligence to 60, and they gain advantage on any Lore and Logic tests regarding their Mechanicus Instruction (physics, biology, chemistry, etc). Normal Verispex Adepts do not benefit from this trait!  Verispex Armor: The armor counts as having an in-built auspex, chrono, combi-tool, and +10 bonus to Logic (Investigation) and Medicae tests for analyzing information in the field.  Verispex Helm: The helmet includes both infra-red goggles and a photo-visor. In addition, add +10 to Navigation (Tracking), Awareness (Sight), and Intuition (Surroundings).</p>"
        },
